    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρβηλος</span></b> , ὁ (Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Nic.
		</span></i> l.c.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>semicircular
				knife,</i> used by cobblers, i.e. leather-workers (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρβηλοι γὰρ τὰ δέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάρβηλα</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				423
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Geom.,
				<i>figure resembling it in shape,</i> contained by three
			semicircles with coincident diameters &lt;*&gt;, <i><span class="en">
				Papp.
				208.12
			</span></i>.</div>
